sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App
    participant API
    participant DB

    User->>App: Open document
    App->>API: GET /document/42
    API->>DB: SELECT *
    DB-->>API: rows
    API-->>App: 200 OK
    App-->>User: Render preview

    alt Save succeeds
        User->>App: Save
        App->>API: PUT /document/42
        API-->>App: 204 No Content
    else Save fails
        User->>App: Save
        App->>API: PUT /document/42
        API-->>App: 409 Conflict
        App-->>User: Show error
    end
